      "writtenOn": "2017-12-06T17:57:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think the transaction should be rejected if the passed in thread does not match the node thread and both are set. For your reverse case, I don\u0027t know if it is better to reject the transaction or allow it. If both are needed, we can let user-space decide with a separate flag.",
